@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write API tests",
  "priority": 1
}

### List tasks
GET {{base}}/tasks

### Read created task (fresh server: ID 1)
GET {{base}}/tasks/1

### Complete task
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/1

### Invalid input (expect 422)
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "x", "priority": 999}

### Remove task
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1
